completed_at: "2026-09-13T17:45:07.934Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "verifyPmCliGrammar or the command-grammar gate reports a terminal_consolidation_owner finding when a consolidation row's owner is closed, canceled or missing and the command is not carried by the alias relocation table, with a negative-control fixture; config, profile, schema and init rows name pm-npr3; assurance and history-author-acknowledge rows name the open delivery task filed beside this issue; the contracts fixture is regenerated; The gate's negative control proves a stale-owner row fails upward in CI"
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
resolution: "Enforced complete all-status consolidation ownership, corrected completed dispositions and alias provenance, and retained compact TOON destination tables; documented review validation and provider limits."
expected_result: "Missing, closed or canceled consolidation owners and incomplete tracker snapshots fail the mandatory grammar gate; valid completed paths and aliases remain certifiable."
actual_result: "8819 tests passed at exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage. Linked owner and grammar regressions and build passed again after the test-harness JSDoc addition; all first-head hosted checks and analyzers passed, with CodeRabbit reporting no actionable findings. Final-head revalidation is required before merge."
